  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#xbf;&#xbf;ACP Trust Fund for Private Sector Operations&#xbf; Contribution Agreement with EIB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;`&#xbf;ACP Trust Fund for Private Sector Operations&#xbf; Contribution Agreement with EIB financed from the general budget of the European Union under the NDICI&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ACP Trust Fund shall target private sector high risk and high impact operations, as previously under the Impact Finance Envelope, which are part of a single-package approach alongside the EIB Dedicated ACP Window guarantee and complements EFSD+ open architecture guarantee operations in ACP countries by the EIB and other Development FIs&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
